msgstr "Confirmed {count} claims"

msgid "已领取或未到领取时间"
msgstr "Already claimed or not yet available"

msgid "待核查：未识别到领取按钮或领取状态"
msgstr "Needs review: claim button or status not recognized"

msgid "待核查：点击后未确认奖励弹窗"
msgstr "Needs review: reward popup not confirmed after click"

msgid "待核查：领取按钮持续出现"
msgstr "Needs review: claim button keeps appearing"

msgid "输入"
msgstr "Input"

msgid "会话鼠标驱动"
msgstr "Session Mouse Driver"

msgid "鼠标输入方式，对所有任务生效"
msgstr "How mouse input is sent; applies to all tasks"

msgid "在 RDP 会话里用 Interception 驱动产生真实鼠标点击（能过新手引导、不受窗口激活影响）；绑定不到设备时自动退回 PostMessage。关掉则始终用 PostMessage"
msgstr "Inside an RDP session, use the Interception driver to send real mouse clicks (works with tutorials and is not affected by window activation); falls back to PostMessage automatically when no device can be bound. When off, PostMessage is always used"

msgid "调试"
msgstr "Debug"

msgid "调试截图"
msgstr "Debug Screenshots"

msgid "排查问题用的全局开关，对所有任务生效"
msgstr "Global troubleshooting switches; apply to all tasks"

msgid "把每个任务各阶段的截图保存到 screenshots/任务名/日期/ 下，每个任务最多保留 400 张；关掉就不存"
msgstr "Save screenshots of each stage under screenshots/<task>/<date>/, keeping at most 400 per task; nothing is saved when off"

msgid "阵容与助战"
msgstr "Lineup & Support"

msgid "编队名"
msgstr "Preset Name"

msgid "借好友助战"
msgstr "Borrow Friend Support"

msgid "助战角色"
msgstr "Support Doll"

msgid "助战最低椎数"
msgstr "Minimum Support Neural Upgrades"

msgid "找不到就借战力最高"
msgstr "Fall Back to Highest Power"

msgid "沿用全局"
msgstr "Use Global"

msgid "开"
msgstr "On"

msgid "关"
msgstr "Off"

msgid "所有会进部署界面的任务共用。优先级：内置默认 → 这里的全局值 → 各场景单独设置（新版界面里在各板块直接改）"
msgstr "Shared by every task that enters the deployment screen. Priority: built-in defaults → these global values → per-scene settings (editable per section in the new UI)"

msgid "体力"
msgstr "Stamina"

msgid "自动使用体力药"
msgstr "Auto Restore Stamina"

msgid "体力不足时怎么办，对推图和一键日常等所有任务生效"
msgstr "What to do when stamina runs out; applies to stage push, dailies and all other tasks"

msgid "体力不足弹出「情报拼图补充」时，只用调度室储存和情报拼图道具（含接入密钥）恢复，每次用 1 份，绝不使用坍塌晶条\n关闭时：推图遇到体力不足直接停止；一键日常刷体力则当作刷完，继续后面的任务"
msgstr "When the stamina refill dialog appears, restore only with dispatch-room storage and intel puzzle items (including access keys), one at a time; Collapse Crystals are never used\nWhen off: stage push stops on low stamina; the daily stamina run counts as finished and continues with the next task"

msgid "默认编队：下面各场景没单独填编队时都用它（游戏里可自定义名字，默认 编队1）。留空就不切编队，只补满空位"
msgstr "Default preset, used by every scene below that has no preset of its own (renamable in game, default 编队1). Leave empty to keep the current preset and only fill empty slots"

msgid "默认借不借好友助战：各场景「助战」选「沿用全局」时按这里"
msgstr "Whether to borrow a friend support by default; used when a scene's support option is \"Use Global\""

msgid "要借的助战角色名，须与游戏内显示一致，如 威玛西娜"
msgstr "Name of the support doll to borrow, exactly as shown in game, e.g. 威玛西娜"

msgid "卡片左上角蓝圈里的椎数至少要多少，默认 6"
msgstr "Minimum neural upgrade count shown in the blue circle on the card, default 6"

msgid "没有椎数达标的指定角色时，切到「全部」按战力从高到低借第一个"
msgstr "If the chosen doll is not available with enough upgrades, switch to \"All\" and borrow the highest-power one"

msgid "推图编队"
msgstr "Stage Push Preset"

msgid "推图任务用的编队，留空沿用默认编队"
msgstr "Preset used by the stage push task; leave empty to use the default preset"

msgid "推图助战"
msgstr "Stage Push Support"

msgid "推图任务借不借好友助战，「沿用全局」按上面的「借好友助战」"
msgstr "Whether the stage push task borrows a friend support; \"Use Global\" follows \"Borrow Friend Support\" above"

msgid "竞技场编队"
msgstr "Arena Preset"

msgid "一键日常「竞技场」（实兵演习）用的编队，留空沿用默认编队"
msgstr "Preset used by Dailies \"Arena\" (live-fire exercise); leave empty to use the default preset"

msgid "体力本编队"
msgstr "Stamina Stage Preset"

msgid "一键日常「自动刷体力」手动挑战用的编队，留空沿用默认编队"
msgstr "Preset used by manual challenges in Dailies \"Auto Stamina\"; leave empty to use the default preset"

msgid "班组编队"
msgstr "Squad Preset"

msgid "一键日常「班组」要务用的编队，留空沿用默认编队"
msgstr "Preset used by Dailies \"Squad\" tasks; leave empty to use the default preset"

msgid "尘烟前哨战编队"
msgstr "Dust Smoke Outpost Preset"

msgid "一键日常「班组」里的尘烟前线·前哨战（借助战时选战力最高的人形）用的编队，留空沿用默认编队"
msgstr "Preset used by the Dust Smoke Outpost battle under Dailies \"Squad\" (borrows the highest-power support); leave empty to use the default preset"

msgid "尘烟前哨战助战"
msgstr "Dust Smoke Outpost Support"

msgid "一键日常「班组」里的尘烟前线·前哨战（借助战时选战力最高的人形）借不借好友助战，「沿用全局」按上面的「借好友助战」"
msgstr "Whether the Dust Smoke Outpost battle under Dailies \"Squad\" (borrows the highest-power support) borrows a friend support; \"Use Global\" follows \"Borrow Friend Support\" above"

msgid "活动编队"
msgstr "Event Preset"

msgid "一键日常「活动自律」用的编队，留空沿用默认编队"
msgstr "Preset used by Dailies \"Event Auto\"; leave empty to use the default preset"

msgid "扩编实练编队"
msgstr "Expansion Drill Preset"

msgid "周常「扩编实练」特殊增强关卡用的编队，留空沿用默认编队"
msgstr "Preset used by special enhancement stages of the weekly \"Expansion Drill\"; leave empty to use the default preset"

msgid "停在任意关卡页面或章节选择页启动即可，先回章节起点从左到右推完未通关的关卡，推完自动进下一章"
msgstr "Start from any stage map or the chapter list. Returns to the start of the chapter, clears every uncleared stage from left to right, then moves on to the next chapter"

msgid "战斗内点击自动"
msgstr "Click Auto in Battle"

msgid "推完继续下一章"
msgstr "Continue to Next Chapter"

msgid "进入战斗后若检测到「行动结束」，自动点击右上角的自动战斗按钮\n默认关闭，依赖游戏内全局自动（设置→其他→自动战斗设置）；未开全局自动时再打开"
msgstr "When \"End Turn\" is detected in battle, click the auto-battle button at the top right\nOff by default and relies on the in-game global auto setting (Settings → Other → Auto Battle); turn this on only if global auto is disabled"

msgid "本章能推的都推完（或剩下的都没解锁）后，回章节选择页进入下一章继续推\n下一章没解锁（带锁、点了没反应）就正常结束"
msgstr "After everything clearable in this chapter is done (or the rest is locked), go back to the chapter list and continue with the next chapter\nStops normally if the next chapter is locked"

msgid "尘烟买第3次"
msgstr "Buy 3rd Dust Smoke Run"

msgid "尘烟前线两次免费次数用完后，花 50 坍塌晶条买 1 次参战机会再打一场（每天限 1 次）"
msgstr "After the two free Dust Smoke runs, spend 50 Collapse Crystals on one extra run (once per day)"

msgid "调试工具"
msgstr "Debug Tool"

msgid "按配置点一个文字 / 按 ESC / 截图，供远程调试用"
msgstr "Click a text, press ESC or take a screenshot as configured, for remote debugging"

msgid "先回主页"
msgstr "Return to Main First"

msgid "点击文字"
msgstr "Click Text"

msgid "点击坐标"
msgstr "Click Position"

msgid "按ESC次数"
msgstr "ESC Presses"

msgid "按键"
msgstr "Keys"

msgid "截图并OCR"
msgstr "Screenshot and OCR"

msgid "先执行 ensure_main 回到游戏主页再做后面的动作"
msgstr "Run ensure_main to return to the main screen before the other actions"

msgid "非空时用 OCR 找到这个文字并点击（支持正则），找不到就报错"
msgstr "When set, find this text with OCR and click it (regex supported); fails if not found"

msgid "非空时点击这个相对坐标，格式 x,y（0~1），如 0.3,0.5"
msgstr "When set, click this relative position, format x,y (0~1), e.g. 0.3,0.5"

msgid "点击之后再按几次 ESC"
msgstr "How many times to press ESC after clicking"

msgid "最后按这些键，逗号分隔，键:秒 表示按住多久，如 f2 或 w:1.5,e"
msgstr "Finally press these keys, comma separated; key:seconds holds the key, e.g. f2 or w:1.5,e"

msgid "把当前画面全部 OCR 一遍，文字写进日志，截图存到 screenshots/调试工具/"
msgstr "OCR the whole screen, write the text to the log and save the screenshot under screenshots/调试工具/"
